  "body": "running \n\n```\npython -m synapse.app.homeserver \\\n    --server-name machine.my.domain.name \\\n    --config-path homeserver.yaml \\\n    --generate-config \\\n    --report-stats=[yes|no]\n```\n\nsets, unlike the deb package:\n- registration_shared_secret\n- macaroon_shared_secret\n- server_name\n\nthe deb package sets  idp_redirect_url to an unsable value \"http://test/idp\", also web_client bool is set differenty. I suggest syncing the resulting configuration so that only paths differ, not actual server defaults.\n",
